          "quote": "(node (ref \"J1\") (pin \"21\")) ... (node (ref \"R12\") (pin \"2\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "R9–R12 | 0 Ω (jumpers) | Select which M5Stack bus pin (pin 19/21 for ch.1, pin 20/22 for ch.2) supplies PWM1/PWM2"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "Short R10, R10 for Core2 and CoreS3 / Short R9, R11 for others"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The Core's alternative GPIO bus pins are electrically tied together, potentially causing GPIO contention and preventing the intended variant-specific PWM mapping from operating correctly.",
      "confidence": 0.91
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The netlist shows both alternative GPIO pins in each mapping pair bridged by zero-ohm resistors. This conflicts with the specification's assembly-time selection of one mapping for the Core variant."
